# Allowlist: the image needs the lock, the two build scripts and the package.
# Anything else stays out of the build context, including a local models/
# directory (about 72 MB) and .venv.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!scripts/fetch-weights.sh
!scripts/selfcheck.py
!immich_enhancer/
**/__pycache__
